[[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Lower the cargo box plane.</p><p>1. Using a suitable tool, release the spring (1a) from the mounting points (1b) and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194002472.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Check that the spring is not damaged.</p><p>- Attach the hooks for the spring to the mounting points.</p>"]]